# Homepage Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and configure as needed.
#
# Homepage substitutes {{HOMEPAGE_VAR_NAME}} inside its config YAMLs from
# container env vars carrying the HOMEPAGE_VAR_ prefix. Nothing in config/
# uses one today — add an entry here only when a widget needs a secret, e.g.:
#
# HOMEPAGE_VAR_HOMEASSISTANT_TOKEN=your_home_assistant_long_lived_access_token_here
